  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The acceleration due to gravity&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>&nbsp;at a height&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi></math>&nbsp;from the surface of Earth is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Use the method of binomial expansion to obtain the approximate expression for the acceleration due to gravity at a particular height from the surface of the Earth.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8776;</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>The formula to calculate the acceleration due to gravity at the surface of the Earth is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Divide equation (2) by equation (3) and simplify to obtain the required relation.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>R</mi></mstyle></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>R</mi></mstyle></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p></blockquote>"
